{"id":22918,"author":"ReyCassie","body":"Hello, ive come here to appeal most of my infractions as most are false!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/117745\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/117745\"\u003e117745\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- combat logging - I just left the game on low hearts (no one was around me).\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/119687\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/119687\"\u003e119687\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Team Grief - In this infraction I did not team grief as I was helping my team to defend, I was not blocking the monunent of anything, was just helping the team\u003cbr\u003e1\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/123979\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/123979\"\u003e23979\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- combat logging - same as the last one infraction\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/607441\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/607441\"\u003e607441\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Team spleef - this was false this infraction was given out because it said i spleefed someone when i didnt.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/610709\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/610709\"\u003e610709\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- \u0026nbsp;Do not spawnkill - There was no verbal warning on this, plus i did not cross the intersection on quintus.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/613458\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/613458\"\u003e613458\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Use /report - This was only a sacrastic joke.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/614760\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/614760\"\u003e614760\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Spawn kill - Same as the last spawn killing infraction\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/615809\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/punishments/615809\"\u003e615809\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Watch the caps - i remember, i only said like only a 1-2 words in caps.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/616213\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e616213\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Combat logging - I remember this clearly, i was on ternio and i just got temp banned.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/616833\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e616833\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;- spawn camping - again this was on quintus lol, I wasnt spawn camping, i was standing infront of spawn constantly eating gapples.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/punishments/618057\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\" title